<title>THAILAND: Thailand okays 150,000T zero-tariff corn imports.</title>
<headline>Thailand okays 150,000T zero-tariff corn imports.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai cabinet on Tuesday gave a green light to the industry to import 150,000 tonnes of corn under a zero-tariff scheme to alleviate a shortage caused by a dry spell, a government official said.</p>
<p>The import must be done by August 31 as local supplies were expected to be available by then, the official said.</p>
</text>
